<svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 580 284" role="img" aria-labelledby="meridian-diagram-title meridian-diagram-desc">
  <title id="meridian-diagram-title">MERIDIAN agent graph</title>
  <desc id="meridian-diagram-desc">
    A fixed LangGraph state machine. Sentinel runs pandera contracts on Ray and emits an incident. Triage sets severity, root cause queries three MCP servers, and fix writes a patch with a regression test. A pre-critic dry run and a second-model critic review the patch, with up to three critic rounds. A deterministic verifier replays the failing partition in a sandbox, returning to fix for up to three attempts. Slack approval holds the patch for a human, then a postmortem is written.
  </desc>
